  "body_html": "<h1>liftSubgame_eq_self</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\ntheorem liftSubgame_eq_self {G : ExtensiveGame iota U} [(s : G.State) -&gt; Fintype (G.Action s)] {i : iota} {root : G.State} (beta : (G.subgameAt root).BehaviorStrategy i) : beta.liftSubgame = beta</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>subgameAt</li>\n<li>BehaviorStrategy</li>\n<li>liftSubgame</li>\n</ul>",
